msgstr "완료 시 로그 창 닫기(_C)"

#: gnucash/import-export/aqb/dialog-ab-pref.glade:40
#: gnucash/import-export/aqb/gschemas/org.gnucash.GnuCash.dialogs.import.hbci.gschema.xml.in:16
